        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "日期"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This holds everything you typed and dictated with Hex in the last 14 days, including any password you typed outside a password field. Give it only to an agent you trust, and don't upload it anywhere you wouldn't share your messages." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这里包含你过去 14 天用 Hex 输入和听写的所有内容，包括你在密码栏以外输入的密码。只把它交给你信任的 AI 助手，也不要上传到你不愿分享自己消息的地方。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This holds everything you typed and dictated with Hex on the days you chose, including any password you typed outside a password field. Give it only to an agent you trust, and don't upload it anywhere you wouldn't share your messages." : {
